{"parse":{"title":"Agony Alone May Be Repaid","pageid":302312,"revid":1778249,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Agony Alone May Be Repaid</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/a/af/Talent_Agony_Alone_May_Be_Repaid.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015921\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Agony Alone May Be Repaid\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/a/af/Talent_Agony_Alone_May_Be_Repaid.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015921\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/a/af/Talent_Agony_Alone_May_Be_Repaid.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015921 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/a/af/Talent_Agony_Alone_May_Be_Repaid.png/revision/latest?cb=20240424015921 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Agony Alone May Be Repaid\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Agony_Alone_May_Be_Repaid.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Agony Alone May Be Repaid.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arlecchino\" title=\"Arlecchino\">Arlecchino</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Blood-Debt Directives</b> have the following characteristics:<br /><ul><li>Arlecchino will be granted a <a href=\"/wiki/Bond_of_Life\" title=\"Bond of Life\">Bond of Life</a> worth 130% of her <a href=\"/wiki/Max_HP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Max HP\">Max HP</a> when an opponent to which she herself applied a Directive is defeated.</li><li>5s after a Directive is applied, it will be upgraded to a Blood-Debt Due. When absorbed, it will instead grant Arlecchino a Bond of Life worth 130%.</li></ul>A Bond of Life created in the aforementioned ways cannot exceed the original limit on the value of Bonds of Life obtained through <a href=\"/wiki/All_Is_Ash\" title=\"All Is Ash\">All Is Ash</a>.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Max_HP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Max HP\">Max HP</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bond_of_Life\" title=\"Bond of Life\">Bond of Life</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Agony Alone May Be Repaid</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Arlecchino\" title=\"Arlecchino\">Arlecchino</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Preview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Preview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Preview\">Preview</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-e