view.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/0/0d/Agony_Alone_May_Be_Repaid_Preview.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/380?cb=20240422131215\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Agony_Alone_May_Be_Repaid_Preview.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Blood-Debt Directive and Blood-Debt Due</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAgony_Alone_May_Be_Repaid%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Agony Alone May Be Repaid</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">唯苦痛可偿还</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wéi Kǔtòng kě Chánghuán</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Only Pain Can Be Repaid</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">唯苦痛可償還</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wéi Kǔtòng kě Chánghuán</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">償えるものは苦痛のみ</span><br /><small><i>Tsunagaeru Mono wa Kutsuu nomi</i></small></td><td>Only Pain Can Be Atoned</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">고통만이</span> <span lang=\"ko\">갚을</span> <span lang=\"ko\">수</span> <span lang=\"ko\">있고</span><br /><small><i>Gotongmani Gapeul Su Itgo</i></small></td><td>Only Pain Can Repay<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ko&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ko-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>• 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Solo el sufrimiento podr<span lang=\"es\">á</span> redimir</td><td>Only Suffering Can Redeem</td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Seule la douleur peut rembourser</td><td>Only Pain May Repay</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Лишь</span> <span lang=\"ru\">страдания</span> <span lang=\"ru\">искупят</span><br /><small><i>Lish' stradaniya iskupyat</i></small></td><td>Only Suffering Will Atone</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Agony Alone May Be Repaid</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Chỉ Khổ Đau Mới Có Thể Bù Đắp</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Nur Qualen vergelten</td><td>Only Agonies Repay</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Agony Alone May Be Repaid</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Somente a Dor pode ser Compensada</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Yaln<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>zca Ac<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span> Telafi Edebilir</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Agonia rivendicata</td><td>Claimed Agony</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ko-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-ko_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><b>Korean:</b>&#160;Arlecchino's three Talents connect into a single sentence,